{
  "uid": "interview-coach-ux",
  "title": "interview-coach · 화면 흐름",
  "tags": [
    "interview-coach",
    "ux"
  ],
  "timezone": "Asia/Seoul",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "화면 흐름 · 불편 신호 — 서버 로거 `UxEvent` 한 줄(Alloy `stream=\"ux\"`, Loki 30일). **답 · 음성 · 입력 글자는 없다.** 어디서 · 왜는 `tools/ux-telemetry analyze` 보고서가 답한다(interview-coach docs/UX-TELEMETRY.md)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "이벤트 (종류별)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (type) (count_over_time({namespace=\"interview-coach\", stream=\"ux\"} | regexp `UxEvent (?P<j>\\{.*\\})` | line_format `{{.j}}` | json type=\"type\" [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            },
            "fillOpacity": 60
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "불편 신호 (종류별)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (count_over_time({namespace=\"interview-coach\", stream=\"ux\"} |= `\"type\":\"friction\"` | regexp `UxEvent (?P<j>\\{.*\\})` | line_format `{{.j}}` | json kind=\"name\" [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            },
            "fillOpacity": 60
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "불편 신호가 많은 요소 (기간 전체)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "topk(15, sum by (kind, el, route) (count_over_time({namespace=\"interview-coach\", stream=\"ux\"} |= `\"type\":\"friction\"` | regexp `UxEvent (?P<j>\\{.*\\})` | line_format `{{.j}}` | json kind=\"name\", el=\"el\", route=\"route\" [$__range])))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Value",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "흐름 결과 (기간 전체)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (name, outcome) (count_over_time({namespace=\"interview-coach\", stream=\"ux\"} |= `\"type\":\"flow\"` | regexp `UxEvent (?P<j>\\{.*\\})` | line_format `{{.j}}` | json name=\"name\", outcome=\"props.outcome\" | outcome!=\"step\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Value",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "description": "answer: 쓰기 시작(start) → 보냄(done) · 못 보냄(fail) · 두고 떠남(abandon) · 다시 시작(restart)"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "쓰기 시작 → 보내기까지 (answer done)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.5, {namespace=\"interview-coach\", stream=\"ux\"} |= `\"name\":\"answer\"` |= `\"outcome\":\"done\"` | regexp `UxEvent (?P<j>\\{.*\\})` | line_format `{{.j}}` | json ms=\"props.ms\" | unwrap ms [$__interval]) by (route)",
          "legendFormat": "중앙 {{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "채점 기다림 (grading) 중앙 · p95",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.5, {namespace=\"interview-coach\", stream=\"ux\"} |= `\"name\":\"wait\"` | regexp `UxEvent (?P<j>\\{.*\\})` | line_format `{{.j}}` | json ms=\"props.ms\", what=\"props.what\" | what=\"grading\" | unwrap ms [$__interval]) by (what)",
          "legendFormat": "중앙"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.95, {namespace=\"interview-coach\", stream=\"ux\"} |= `\"name\":\"wait\"` | regexp `UxEvent (?P<j>\\{.*\\})` | line_format `{{.j}}` | json ms=\"props.ms\", what=\"props.what\" | what=\"grading\" | unwrap ms [$__interval]) by (what)",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "화면 열람 (기간 전체)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (route) (count_over_time({namespace=\"interview-coach\", stream=\"ux\"} |= `\"type\":\"page\"` | regexp `UxEvent (?P<j>\\{.*\\})` | line_format `{{.j}}` | json route=\"route\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Value",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "수신 · 버림 (서버 지표)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (increase(coach_ux_events_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "최근 불편 신호",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{namespace=\"interview-coach\", stream=\"ux\"} |= `\"type\":\"friction\"` | regexp `UxEvent (?P<j>\\{.*\\})` | line_format `{{.j}}`"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
